### ============================================
### TEST REFRESH TOKEN FLOW
### ============================================
### 
### Prerequisites:
### 1. Set environment variables:
###    - SERVICE_EMAIL atau SERVICE_USERNAME
###    - SERVICE_PASSWORD
###    - BACKEND_URL atau NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL
### 
### 2. Pastikan server sudah running di port 4000 (atau sesuai BACKEND_URL)
###
### ============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@serviceEmail = your-service-email@example.com
@servicePassword = your-service-password

### ============================================
### STEP 1: Login untuk mendapatkan tokens
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{serviceEmail}}",
  "password": "{{servicePassword}}"
}

### Response akan berisi:
### {
###   "accessToken": "...",
###   "refreshToken": "...",
###   "sessionId": "..."
### }
###
### Simpan refreshToken untuk step berikutnya

### ============================================
### STEP 2: Test Refresh Token Endpoint
### ============================================
### Ganti YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN dengan refreshToken dari step 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json
X-Refresh-Token: YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "accessToken": "new_access_token...",
###   "refreshToken": "new_refresh_token...",
###   "sessionId": "..."
### }

### ============================================
### STEP 3: Test dengan Access Token yang sudah expired
### ============================================
### Gunakan accessToken lama (yang sudah expired) untuk test protected endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer EXPIRED_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
### Server seharusnya auto-refresh jika ada refresh token di cookie/header

### ============================================
### STEP 4: Test Refresh Token Rotation
### ============================================
### Refresh token seharusnya di-rotate (token lama tidak bisa digunakan lagi)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json
X-Refresh-Token: OLD_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized (karena token sudah di-rotate)

### ============================================
### STEP 5: Test dengan Refresh Token yang expired
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json
X-Refresh-Token: EXPIRED_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

### ============================================
### STEP 6: Test tanpa Refresh Token
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized - "No refresh token provided"

### ============================================
### STEP 7: Test dengan Invalid Refresh Token
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json
X-Refresh-Token: invalid_token_here

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized - "Invalid refresh token"

